#SUBSCRIBED https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sixvable/proxy-rule-icons-png/stash-release/universal.stoverride
name: 通用分流｜保留机场 DNS
desc: 地区组内直接选择 Auto、Fallback 或具体节点，DNS-Global 可选地区组。完整保留机场 DNS、IPv6、节点和订阅更新。仅需这一份覆写；停用旧的可选开启 IPv6 覆写。适用于 Stash 3.6+。
category: 自用分流
version: 2026.11.14.3
mode: rule
proxy-groups: #!replace
- name: Proxy
  type: select
  icon: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Koolson/Qure@master/IconSet/Color/Rocket.png
  proxies:
  - HongKong
  - TaiWan
  - Japan
  - Singapore
  - Southeast.Asia
  - America
  - UnitedKingdom
  - Germany
  - Europe
  - AllServer
  - DIRECT
- name: Final
  type: select
  icon: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Koolson/Qure@master/IconSet/Color/Final.png
  proxies:
  - Proxy
  - AllServer
  - DIRECT
- name: HongKong
  type: select
  icon: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Koolson/Qure@master/IconSet/Color/Hong_Kong.png
  proxies:
  - HK-Auto
  - HK-FallBack
  - DIRECT
  include-all: true
  filter: (?i)(?:^(?:HK\-Auto|HK\-FallBack|DIRECT)$|(?:^(?=(?:^(?=.*(.))(?!.*(群|邀请|返利|循环|官网|客服|网站|网址|获取|订阅|流量|到期|机场|下次|版本|官址|备用|过期|已用|联系|邮箱|工单|贩卖|通知|倒卖|防止|国内|地址|频道|无法|说明|使用|提示|特别|访问|支持|教程|关注|更新|作者|加入|(\b(USE|USED|TOTAL|Traffic|Expire|EMAIL|Panel|Channel|Author|Reset|Refresh)\b|(\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}|\d+G)))).*$))(?=[\s\S]*(?:港|香港|🇭🇰|\bHK\b|\bHKG\b|Hong\s*Kong|HongKong|Hong))[\s\S]+$))
- name: TaiWan
  type: select
  icon: https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Koolson/Qure@master/IconSet/Color/Taiwan.png
  proxies:
  - TW-Auto
  - TW-FallBack
  - DIRECT
  include-all: true
  filter: (?i)(?:^(?:TW\-Auto|TW\-FallBack|DIRECT)$|(?:^(?=(?:^(?=.*(.))(?!.*(群|邀请|返利|循环|官网|客服|网站|网址|获取|订阅|流量|到期|机场|下次|版本|官址|备用|过期|已用|联系|邮箱|工单|贩卖|通知|倒卖|防止|国内|地址|频道|无法|说明|使用|提示|特别|访问|支持|教程|关注|更新|作者|加入|(\b(USE|USED|TOTAL|Traffic|Expire|EMAIL|Panel|Channel|Author|Reset|Refresh)\b|(\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}|\d+G)))).*$))(?=[\s\S]*(?:台|台湾|台灣|臺灣|湾|灣|🇹🇼|\bTW\b|\bTWN\b|Taiwan|Taipei|Hinet|CHT))[\s\S]+$))
